    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ălĭbĭlis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		alo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>affording nourishment</i>, <i>nutrilious</i>,
				<i>nourishing</i> (perh. only in Varr.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lac,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">casei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 11, 2</span></i>
			, § 3.—<i>Pass.</i> of that
			which readily grows or fattens: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ita pulli alibiliores fiunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
